    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Internet Fisherman&quot; is an idle fishing game where you can obtain rare fish every 2 hours and add them to your Steam inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can feed fish to cats to increase affection, and they will appear on the affection leaderboard, competing with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare fish can be either fed to cats or listed on the Steam Community Market for trading with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affection unlocks cats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiger Cat = 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Cat = 5000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Cat = 100000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demon Cat = ?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bat Cat = ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have carefully crafted an immersive atmosphere and background music for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy playing!</p>",
